@startuml USB Port Refresh
title Refreshing Available USB Ports

actor Admin
participant "Admin App" as AdminApp

Admin -> AdminApp: On device registration screen
Admin -> AdminApp: Click "Refresh" button
AdminApp -> AdminApp: Scan system for serial ports
AdminApp -> AdminApp: Get list of available COM/tty ports
AdminApp -> AdminApp: Update port dropdown list
AdminApp -> Admin: Display available USB devices

@enduml
